bd13d5a0906be48e"}," feats during the same round. You can use the Pin and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Crush"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Crush","referenceId":"reference:fd4982bc31020a05"}," feats in the same round, however.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
